---
// DisclaimerBanner.astro
---

<aside
  class="w-full bg-slate-950/90 border-y border-amber-900/30 px-4 py-3 text-center"
  role="note"
  aria-label="Synthetic Data Compliance Notice"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-amber-300/90">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
      <span>EDUCATIONAL & SIMULATION NOTICE:</span>
    </div>
    <span class="text-slate-400">
      All Bank Identifier Codes (BICs), IBAN accounts, entities, and transactions displayed in SwiftFlow 3D are 100% synthetic and generated exclusively for technical demonstration purposes. No real financial data or live SWIFT networks are accessed.
    </span>
  </div>
</aside>
